   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_24",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ah, it's been a long day.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What do you get a teacher?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Most teachers say a heartfelt note means the most. Pair it with something small, like a coffee voucher or nice chocolate.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.53,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg8",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Not mugs?",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.63,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Teachers often have a cupboard full of mugs already, so I'd skip those.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.62,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg8",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My son wants to give his teacher",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.05,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "a drawing he made.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.66,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg8"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's perfect. Teachers keep those for years. You could add a small gift card to go with it.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.84,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg8",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
